sequenceDiagram
  participant A as site-a
  participant B as site-b
  participant O as operator
  Note over A,B: normal state: A primary, B secondary
  O->>A: demote (in a planned failover)
  A-->>B: last changes are synchronised
  O->>B: promote
  Note over B: clients connect to B
  Note over A: disaster: A is unavailable
  O->>B: promote --force
  O->>A: after it returns: demote
  O->>A: resync
  B-->>A: full synchronisation
  O->>B: demote
  O->>A: promote (failback)
